+# TLS certificate verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, including development builds, and this applies going forward. Development and testing use self-signed certificates rather than disabling verification. Traffic uses HTTPS everywhere, with no plaintext exception, since proper certificate management is now in place.
